# Captured runtime logs. Bot API URLs embed the bot token, so committing
# an engine log publishes the credential (it happened: the token appeared
# 1,342 times in realrun-evidence/server.log). Structured evidence files
# (*.json / *.jsonl / GRADE_REPORT.md) stay tracked; raw logs do not.
*.log
realrun-evidence/**/*.log

# Type checkers
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
